      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present 29 Fleurville, Carysfort Avenue, Blackrock, Co. Dublin to the market a superb three-bedroom, two-bathroom mid terraced family home ideally positioned within this mature and highly sought-after residential development. Fleurville enjoys an enviable location just moments from Blackrock Village, one of South Dublin's most desirable addresses, offering an outstanding selection of cafés, restaurants, boutiques, supermarkets and everyday conveniences. Blackrock Shopping Centre, the seafront promenade and Rockfield Park are all within easy reach, while the area is renowned for its excellent choice of prestigious primary and secondary schools. Public transport is second to none with the DART, numerous Dublin Bus routes and convenient access to the N11 and M50 all close by.\nBright and well-proportioned internal living accommodation spans to c. 80 sqm, and comprises of entrance hallway, extremely spacious lounge, and fully fitted kitchen on the ground floor, while upstairs hosts master bedroom with ensuite, two double bedrooms, and a main family bathroom. The property offers an excellent layout with bright, airy accommodation throughout.\nNo. 29 is presented as a clean blank canvas, offering the successful purchaser the perfect opportunity to modernise and create a wonderful family home tailored to their own taste and specification. Externally, the property benefits from off street parking to the front, while to the rear lies a beautifully private south facing garden laid in lawn, providing the perfect setting for outdoor entertaining, family life and enjoying sunshine throughout the day.\nRarely does an opportunity arise to acquire a home with such outstanding potential in one of South Dublin's most prestigious locations. Early viewing is highly recommended contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers today to arrange a viewing!\nAdditional Features;\n\n\n• c. 80 sqm\n• BER C\n• 3 Bed / 2 Bath\n• Mid terraced home\n• Off street parking\n• Gas heating\n• Double glazed windows\n• Fully fitted kitchen\n• Blank canvas\n• Sunny south facing rear garden in lawn\n• Bright and airy\n• Well-proportioned layout throughout\n• Plenty of transport links nearby\n• Wide range of local amenities within walking distance\n• Highly sought after location\n• Ideal for a wide range of buyers\n• Viewing highly advised!\n\n\nMeasurements;\nLiving Room: 4.20m X 6.19m.\nKitchen: 3.02m X 4.06m.\nBedroom 1: 3.27m X 3.33m.\nBedroom 2: 2.02m X 4.38m.\nBedroom 3: 2.08m X 3.42m.\nBathroom: 2.24m X 1.76m.\nEn-suite: 0.83m X 1.95m.\nHallway: 1.98m X 2.85m.\n\nDirections;\nEircode: A94 D5N0"
      },
